WEB → NATIVE PARITY MAP (every branch + t() of the web source reproduced)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  isOn = def.stateField&&state ? state[field] : localToggle
        -> ToggleCommandTileResolution (pending/unknown/resolved) via P1/S8 ToggleStateProviding
           + local optimistic flip for uncontrolled defs.
  onStyles[variant] ON treatment (panel/icon/dot/text tint)
        -> variant.tone (default→accent, danger→danger, success→success); panel border+tint,
           icon box tint, status dot, ON value line all take the tone when on.
  Icon = isOn ? def.icon : def.iconOff ?? def.icon  -> def.iconName(isOn:) SF Symbol swap.
  handleClick: loading→noop; isOn→onExecute(commandOff); else inputConfig→onRequestDialog
               else onExecute(command, params); uncontrolled flips localToggle.
        -> model.activate() reproduces all four branches exactly (execute-off / dialog /
           execute-on + optimistic flip), guarded while executing/offline/loading.
  loading→spinner+opacity-50  -> isExecuting (+ pending) spinner, panel opacity 0.5.
  lastStatus startsWith('✓')  -> ToggleCommandTileOutcome.parse (green/red + SF Symbol).
  favorite star (amber, stopPropagation) -> sibling overlay Button, TSTone.warning, own a11y id.
  corner on/off dot           -> ToggleCommandTileStatusDot (tone when on, muted when off).
  t('commands.toggleFavorite'|'commands.on'|'commands.off') -> verbatim keys via P1/S10 facade.
  Charts/maps: none in source -> none added (Swift Charts/MapKit N/A for this surface).

STATES RENDERED (all): loading(pending controlled state, skeleton + spinner, non-interactive),
  empty(unknown/missing field → muted localized fallback), error(failed outcome, tile stays
  tappable = retry), stale(freshness window → stale chip), offline(cached value + offline chip,
  blocked), plus executing / on / off.

i18n KEYS: source keys commands.toggleFavorite="Toggle favorite", commands.on="ON",
  commands.off="OFF" — present in master Localizable.xcstrings (translation.commands.*) AND
  declared verbatim in ToggleCommandTile.strings. Native chrome keys commands.toggle.* all
  declared + referenced (referenced==declared verified). No English literals in code (every
  string via NSLocalizedString value: fallback through the facade).

